    "description": {
      "content": "The Unify Universal API provides a unified REST interface for the Unify platform's LLM routing, persistence, logging, assistant management, project management, spaces, context, and organization features. The API base URL is https://api.unify.ai/v0 and all endpoints require Bearer token authentication via the UNIFY_KEY environment variable.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Unify",
